[Unit]
Description=Purple — the full skynet-side brain (voice + vision + conductor + nav)
# The single start/stop knob for Purple's brain:
#   systemctl --user start  purple.target   # everything up
#   systemctl --user stop   purple.target   # everything down (PartOf on each svc)
#   systemctl --user restart purple.target
# Members pull themselves in via [Install] WantedBy=purple.target (once enabled).
# Not enabled on default.target -> manual only; nothing autostarts at boot.
#
# Scope: Purple's BRAIN on skynet. Purple's BODY (viser_control --voice on the
# Pi) is autostarted by labwc on the Pi and is not managed here.
